\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Bach Chorales trained on 512-token crops, test NLL by position bucket (lower is better, 5 seeds). MapPoPE is the best arm in distribution and by far the worst outside it. Adding a per-token phase offset to its kernel --- the freedom PoPE removes and rotating $Q,K$ provides --- fixes it.\relax }}{9}{table.caption.31}\protected@file@percent }
